  "title": "Russ Buckley Appointed Group Chief Risk Officer at Hamilton",
  "summary": "PEMBROKE, BERMUDA, August 6, 2025 — Hamilton Insurance Group, Ltd. (NYSE: HG) (“Hamilton” or the “Company”) today announced the appointment of Russ Buckley as Group Chief Risk Officer. Buckley will join the Company’s Executive Management team, reporting to Pina Albo, Chief Executive Officer, with the official start date in the coming weeks to be confirmed. […]",
